•	Project Title: Smart Eco-Tourism Village with Solar-Powered Cold Storage
2.	About Project:
This project shows a small smart village where:
•	Tourists can visit and enjoy nature
•	Farmers can keep fruits fresh using solar power
•	The entire village uses eco-friendly energy like solar, wind, and biogas etc.
3.	Why This Project:
•	In many villages, fruits get spoiled because there is no Cold Storage.
•	Tourists don’t visit villages much because there are not enough facilities.
•	I wanted to help farmers and also make villages a beautiful place for tourists.
4.	What Project Will have:
1.	Solar-Powered Cold Storage Box
o	A small box that uses solar power to stay cool
o	Farmers can store fruits like mangoes and bananas
2.	Eco-Friendly Tourist Village
o	Houses with solar lights to save money
o	Rainwater harvesting system, to show how to save rainwater
o	A small windmill to generate electricity etc.
o	Biogas plant made from cow dung
o	Organic farming to grow crops

5.	What Problems This Project Solves:
•	Fruits stay fresh so farmers don’t lose money
•	Tourists visit and villages earn more
•	Saves electricity using solar and wind
•	Keeps the village clean and green
6.	Materials I Will Use:
•	Cardboard, Thermocol, Toy Trees and Animals
•	Small model Solar panel and Battery
•	Small LED light, fan and aluminium foil
•	Plastic bottles for water tank etc.

